# Production image build context (services/api/Dockerfile, apps/web/Dockerfile). An allowlist: everything is
# excluded, then only what an image needs is added back. Secrets (.env files), data/, kit/, the git history,
# local environments, caches, cassettes, and reports never enter the context.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!services/api/pyproject.toml
!services/api/README.md
!services/api/src/
!services/api/config/
!data_platform/pyproject.toml
!data_platform/README.md
!data_platform/src/
!data_platform/config/
!data_platform/dbt/
!data_platform/sample/
!data_platform/seed/
!data_platform/mappings/
!ml/pyproject.toml
!ml/README.md
!evals/pyproject.toml
!evals/README.md
!evals/reports/summaries/
!policies/
!apps/web/
!deploy/caddy/

**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
apps/web/node_modules
apps/web/dist
apps/web/coverage
apps/web/.shots
apps/web/.vite
apps/web/*.tsbuildinfo
data_platform/dbt/target
data_platform/dbt/logs
